          "short": "$y=(x-3)^2+1$",
          "worked": "Translate 3 units right:\n\n$$y=(x-3)^2$$\n\nThen translate 1 unit up:\n\n$$y=(x-3)^2+1$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 24
      },
      {
